      "content": "putting myself out there? how? i feel like if i try to say anything it just makes it worse. it's like there's this huge wall between me and everyone else. it doesn't even feel like i'm part of the world anymore. i'm just watching it happen from the outside. it would be so much easier if i just wasn't here to feel this nothingness.",
